    "previous_model_response": "Since \\(PT=\\frac25 PS\\), the remaining base is\n\n\\[\nTS=PS-PT=\\frac35 PS.\n\\]\n\nTriangle \\(RST\\) has base \\(TS\\) and height \\(RS\\), so\n\n\\[\n7=\\frac12\\left(\\frac35 PS\\right)(RS)\n=\\frac3{10}(PS\\cdot RS).\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the area of rectangle \\(PQRS\\) is\n\n\\[\n\\frac{7\\cdot10}{3}=\\boxed{\\frac{70}{3}}.\n\\]\n\nFinal value: \\(\\frac{70}{3}\\)",
    "correction": "Preserve source GT 23; exact area is 70/3 (23.333?)."
